{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>ויכינו, כי באימה</b> — On account of the terror upon them, they prepared an altar to El, that He might help them." "<b>ויעלו</b> — The one who offers is one, namely Joshua the priest, who initially offered the sacrifices. And it says ויעלו (plural) because his brothers assisted him." "<b>עולות לבקר</b> — Meaning the burnt offerings fitting for morning and evening, and they are two."], :book :ezra, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Ezra -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:41:45.301359827Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}